2 CONT * English Wikipedia: [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jens_Lauritz_Arup Jens Lauritz Arup]
2 CONT * vestraat.net: [http://vestraat.net/TNG/getperson.php?personID=I101682&tree=IEA Jens Laurits Arup]
2 CONT * A. Brandrud: biografi i NBL1, bd. 1, 1923
