2 _MARNM Strøm
1 NAME Hanna Winsnes
1 NAME Hanna Olava //
2 GIVN Hanna Olava
2 SURN Strøm
1 NAME Hanna Winsnes
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 AUG 1789
2 ADDR
3 CITY Drammen
3 STAE Buskerud
3 CTRY Norge
