1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record and obituary:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=dedekam&GSbyrel=all&GSdyrel=all&GSob=n&GRid=97173707&df=all&
2 CONT
