1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Høyland Gards- og ættesoge page 291 (62f), page 464 (76). The son Rasmus (76j) was not b. 6 jun. 1878 and d. 13 aug. 1881 as written in Høyland Gards- og ættesoge. That is a boy named Racin with other parents. The 
2 CONC son Rasmus (76j) was b. 13 oct. 1877 and emigrated with his father and stephmother to America in 1892 and lived with them in York, Fillmore co, Minnesota in 1895.
