1 NAME Anna Dorothea Christophersdatter /Zinke/
2 GIVN Anna Dorothea Christophersdatter
2 SURN Zinke
2 _MARNM Zincke
2 NICK Zinche
1 NAME Anna Dorothea Zinche
1 NAME Anna Dorothea /Christophersdatter/
2 GIVN Anna Dorothea
2 SURN Christophersdatter
1 NAME Anna Dorothea Zinche
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 19 APR 1768
2 PLAC Fredrikstad
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1769
