2 CONC ame to Bjørnør in 1831 though, and while Strøm was their stated destination they already lived at Sundet by 1833, when his mother died.)
2 CONT * [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/2387/15269/28 Wedding 1857], Bjørnør, Sør-Trøndelag, Norway. Note that they got married *after* their first child together was born, but before she was baptised. Since this was Ole's third c
2 CONC hild outside of wedlock it's tempting to speculate whether there was some pressure involved to marry.
